From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Annika Wickert <6527744+awlx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:26:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] batman-adv: skip stale gateways

A gateway that loses power stays selected for up to 200 s, so the mesh clients have no IPv4 uplink. The patch makes batman-adv skip a gateway without OGMs for 3 originator intervals (15 s with the Gluon interval of 5 s) in the gateway election.
---
 .../0004-batman-adv-skip-stale-gateways.patch | 188 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 188 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/packages/routing/0004-batman-adv-skip-stale-gateways.patch

