+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Annika Wickert <6527744+awlx@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:26:53 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] batman-adv: gw: skip stale gateways
+
+A gateway that loses power stays selected for up to 200 s (neighbor purge). Skip a gateway without an OGM for 3 originator intervals (at least 5 s) in the election.
+---
+ ...03-batman-adv-gw-skip-stale-gateways.patch | 168 ++++++++++++++++++
+ 1 file changed, 168 insertions(+)
+ create mode 100644 batman-adv/patches/2003-batman-adv-gw-skip-stale-gateways.patch
+
+diff --git a/batman-adv/patches/2003-batman-adv-gw-skip-stale-gateways.patch b/batman-adv/patches/2003-batman-adv-gw-skip-stale-gateways.patch
+new file mode 100644
+index 0000000..2e28c87
+--- /dev/null
++++ b/batman-adv/patches/2003-batman-adv-gw-skip-stale-gateways.patch
+@@ -0,0 +1,168 @@
++From: Annika Wickert <6527744+awlx@users.noreply.github.com>
++Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0100
++Subject: batman-adv: gw: skip stale gateways
++
++A gateway that loses power stays selected until the neighbor purge
++(BATADV_PURGE_TIMEOUT, 200 s): its metric does not change without OGMs,
++and the router towards it stays until the purge. In this time the clients
++of the mesh have no IPv4 uplink.
++
++Mark a gateway as stale when no OGM of it arrived for 3 originator
++intervals (at least 5 s). The election skips stale gateways, and a stale
++selected gateway causes a new election. A stale gateway stays selected
++when no other gateway has OGMs. A gateway that comes back is selected
++again only by the normal rules (gw_sel_class), so this adds no flapping.
++
++Signed-off-by: Annika Wickert <6527744+awlx@users.noreply.github.com>
++---
++ net/batman-adv/bat_iv_ogm.c     |  3 +++
++ net/batman-adv/bat_v.c          |  3 +++
++ net/batman-adv/gateway_client.c | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
++ net/batman-adv/gateway_client.h |  2 ++
++ net/batman-adv/main.h           |  3 +++
++ 5 files changed, 49 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
++
++diff --git a/net/batman-adv/bat_iv_ogm.c b/net/batman-adv/bat_iv_ogm.c
++index 5dd3e1f..cacceba 100644
++--- a/net/batman-adv/bat_iv_ogm.c
+++++ b/net/batman-adv/bat_iv_ogm.c
++@@ -2352,6 +2352,9 @@ batadv_iv_gw_get_best_gw_node(struct batadv_priv *bat_priv)
++ 
++ 	rcu_read_lock();
++ 	hlist_for_each_entry_rcu(gw_node, &bat_priv->gw.gateway_list, list) {
+++		if (batadv_gw_node_is_stale(bat_priv, gw_node))
+++			continue;
+++
++ 		orig_node = gw_node->orig_node;
++ 		router = batadv_orig_router_get(orig_node, BATADV_IF_DEFAULT);
++ 		if (!router)
++diff --git a/net/batman-adv/bat_v.c b/net/batman-adv/bat_v.c
++index e13b391..7995c7b 100644
++--- a/net/batman-adv/bat_v.c
+++++ b/net/batman-adv/bat_v.c
++@@ -568,6 +568,9 @@ batadv_v_gw_get_best_gw_node(struct batadv_priv *bat_priv)
++ 		if (!kref_get_unless_zero(&gw_node->refcount))
++ 			continue;
++ 
+++		if (batadv_gw_node_is_stale(bat_priv, gw_node))
+++			goto next;
+++
++ 		if (batadv_v_gw_throughput_get(gw_node, &bw) < 0)
++ 			goto next;
++ 
